{"name": "Probability Dungeon", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/2d39cfafa0a8bf0e8b76fc5de6ff6c17.poster.avif?t=1740311572\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/2d39cfafa0a8bf0e8b76fc5de6ff6c17.webm?t=1740311572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/2d39cfafa0a8bf0e8b76fc5de6ff6c17.mp4?t=1740311572\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A turn-based roguelike where skills have a probability of getting executed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/4fa052795b76f449934721e90ac6fc6e.poster.avif?t=1740311572\" width=\"150\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/4fa052795b76f449934721e90ac6fc6e.webm?t=1740311572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/4fa052795b76f449934721e90ac6fc6e.mp4?t=1740311572\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"84\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/1292751cccbed1603fd5d6ce8d05d231.poster.avif?t=1740311572\" width=\"150\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/1292751cccbed1603fd5d6ce8d05d231.webm?t=1740311572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/1292751cccbed1603fd5d6ce8d05d231.mp4?t=1740311572\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your characters have an ordered list of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every turn, you will need to decide the skill order to adapt to the enemy intents. <br/> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/39797626d099c3688afb0814d8a4f740.poster.avif?t=1740311572\" width=\"432\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/39797626d099c3688afb0814d8a4f740.webm?t=1740311572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/39797626d099c3688afb0814d8a4f740.mp4?t=1740311572\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through the game, you will need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add, replace or improve skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip accessories to characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt and establish different strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For this, you will have to look for shops, try the different events that you will find throughout the map or gain fight rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras_big/ffbe32d67e3040421a617aa9e9e3e7b7.avif?t=1740311572\" height=\"312\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/extras/ffbe32d67e3040421a617aa9e9e3e7b7.avif?t=1740311572\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Characters to combine, with different game styles and skill pools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+150 Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+80 Accessories</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "A turn-based roguelike where skills have a probability of execution. \u00a1You will have to keep improving your list of skills and decide in which order you want them to be executed! Set your strategy, create synergies and try to overcome the different threats.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215240/header.jpg?t=1740311572", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Dice", "Turn-Based", "Deckbuilding", "Mouse Only", "Replay Value", "Roguelike"], "developers": "NiNauk", "publishers": "NiNauk", "release_date": "Feb 23, 2025", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "3215240", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "6 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/jOp1H0n6FMU", "first_seen": 1738796400.0, "review_rank": 1857}